/T (The Trust Fund remains steadfast in its commitment to support more and more NGOs who are on the frontlines of assisting victims and those most left behind, especially women and children. By strengthening the voices of survivors, by being more inclusive, we hope to create a platform for transformative change led by those with lived experiences, ensuring that their needs and insights are at the heart of everything we do.)
/E (The Trust Fund remains steadfast in its commitment to support more and more NGOs who are on the frontlines of assisting victims and those most left behind, especially women and children. By strengthening the voices of survivors, by being more inclusive, we hope to create a platform for transformative change led by those with lived experiences, ensuring that their needs and insights are at the heart of everything we do.)
