/T (In 2023, the Trust Fund managed the implementation of 51 projects under five different grant cycles. Two Call for Proposals for Cycle 7.1 \(Emergency assistance\) and Cycle 7.2 \(Comprehensive assistance\) were launched in the same year.  Under Cycle 7.1, 10 projects \(out of 184 proposals received\) across 9 countries were selected for grants up to US$ 20,000. While under Cycle 7.2, 7 projects \(out of 171 proposals\) across 8 countries were selected for grants up to US$ 60,000.)
/E (In 2023, the Trust Fund managed the implementation of 51 projects under five different grant cycles. Two Call for Proposals for Cycle 7.1 \(Emergency assistance\) and Cycle 7.2 \(Comprehensive assistance\) were launched in the same year.  Under Cycle 7.1, 10 projects \(out of 184 proposals received\) across 9 countries were selected for grants up to US$ 20,000. While under Cycle 7.2, 7 projects \(out of 171 proposals\) across 8 countries were selected for grants up to US$ 60,000.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [6]
