/T (In 2023, the UNVTF completed an independent project evaluation of the Fund.  The main objectives of the evaluation were to draw lessons learned from the evaluation results to help improve the management and operations of the Trust Fund; to further accountability to donors; identify the value add; and formulate recommendations for improvement.)
/E (In 2023, the UNVTF completed an independent project evaluation of the Fund.  The main objectives of the evaluation were to draw lessons learned from the evaluation results to help improve the management and operations of the Trust Fund; to further accountability to donors; identify the value add; and formulate recommendations for improvement.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [4]
