/T (The exercise covered the period from mid-2014 to June 2022, and made efforts to reach out to diverse stakeholders. It used a mixed-methods approach; data collection included both quantitative and qualitative data via different methods, that is, document review, electronic survey, regional focus-group discussions \(FGDs\), and semi-structured interviews with key stakeholders. )
/E (The exercise covered the period from mid-2014 to June 2022, and made efforts to reach out to diverse stakeholders. It used a mixed-methods approach; data collection included both quantitative and qualitative data via different methods, that is, document review, electronic survey, regional focus-group discussions \(FGDs\), and semi-structured interviews with key stakeholders. )
