/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/T (Volta Revival Foundation successfully rescued 55 children trafficked into forced labor, with support from community members and local authorities. The children received comprehensive humanitarian assistance, including shelter, food, hygiene care, health screenings, psychological assessments, and human rights mentorship. Each child was enrolled in school with all academic materials provided and participated in a structured daily routine of education, mentorship, and play activities at the shelter. The foundation worked closely with families, conducting counseling visits to educate them on human rights and trauma. )
