/T (Focus Droits et Access \(FDA\) provided critical support to 80 HIV-positive women and girls with disabilities, who were victims of human trafficking in Nyiragongo territory. These individuals faced severe rights violations, including sexual abuse, forced labor, and exploitation, exacerbated by the ongoing security crisis in North Kivu. FDA distributed essential food kits, containing rice, flour, salt, and oil, and non-food kits that included reusable sanitary strips, soap, clothing, bedding, and other essential items. )
