/T (Caritas Lebanon provided comprehensive psychosocial support to 50 women and girls residing in its shelters. This included 170 individual counseling sessions and group therapy for 120 residents, addressing mental health issues such as depression. In addition to individual follow-ups, residents participated in psychosocial activities like drama therapy and recreational sessions. Children benefited from group sessions that included recreational activities and homework support.)
