506 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (In North Macedonia, Open Gate supported 38 survivors of trafficking through its comprehensive program, helping them rebuild their lives and regain independence. Six beneficiaries successfully re-entered education, with four attending adult education, one resuming primary school, and another enrolling in high school. Regular educational workshops, covering subjects such as mathematics, Macedonian, English, and sciences, were provided at the Center for Victims of Trafficking. Furthermore, vocational training was a significant part of the reintegration process, with four beneficiaries completing a beautician course, seven participating in a filigree course, one finishing a sewing course, and two receiving international certificates in nail care. These programs equipped survivors with marketable skills, fostering their reintegration and economic independence. )
/E (In North Macedonia, Open Gate supported 38 survivors of trafficking through its comprehensive program, helping them rebuild their lives and regain independence. Six beneficiaries successfully re-entered education, with four attending adult education, one resuming primary school, and another enrolling in high school. Regular educational workshops, covering subjects such as mathematics, Macedonian, English, and sciences, were provided at the Center for Victims of Trafficking. Furthermore, vocational training was a significant part of the reintegration process, with four beneficiaries completing a beautician course, seven participating in a filigree course, one finishing a sewing course, and two receiving international certificates in nail care. These programs equipped survivors with marketable skills, fostering their reintegration and economic independence. )
/Alt ()
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
