511 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (Women, Infants, and Children Care Initiative organized a Business Management Skill Acquisition Training for 45 beneficiaries. The workshop covered essential topics such as goal setting, financial literacy, business decision-making, risk-taking, and stress management. Participants were introduced to small-scale business opportunities and received support in selecting income-generating activities for economic rehabilitation. Following the training, each participant was provided with start-up tools to begin their chosen business or vocation. The overall aim was to equip beneficiaries with the skills and knowledge necessary to create successful business plans and achieve financial independence.)
/E (Women, Infants, and Children Care Initiative organized a Business Management Skill Acquisition Training for 45 beneficiaries. The workshop covered essential topics such as goal setting, financial literacy, business decision-making, risk-taking, and stress management. Participants were introduced to small-scale business opportunities and received support in selecting income-generating activities for economic rehabilitation. Following the training, each participant was provided with start-up tools to begin their chosen business or vocation. The overall aim was to equip beneficiaries with the skills and knowledge necessary to create successful business plans and achieve financial independence.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [5]
>>
