580 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (In 2023, the Trust Fund mobilized US$ 1,804,116 from Member States, the private sector, and individuals. The desirable annual funding target for the UNVTF as determined by the Board of Trustees is US$ 2 million annually that would guarantee a predictable and stable level of grants to a growing number of partner NGOs. While close, this level of funding has not been reached in 2023, thus the launch of another grants cycle would require a replenishment of the fund. A table with the detailed list of partners to the Trust Fund can be found in Annex 2.)
/E (In 2023, the Trust Fund mobilized US$ 1,804,116 from Member States, the private sector, and individuals. The desirable annual funding target for the UNVTF as determined by the Board of Trustees is US$ 2 million annually that would guarantee a predictable and stable level of grants to a growing number of partner NGOs. While close, this level of funding has not been reached in 2023, thus the launch of another grants cycle would require a replenishment of the fund. A table with the detailed list of partners to the Trust Fund can be found in Annex 2.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
