/T (Additional expenses charged to the Trust Fund were for operational, oversight and monitoring activities and for the general management of the Trust Fund. In accordance with United Nations Financial Regulations and as per the Terms of Reference of the Trust Fund, programme support costs \(PSC\) were levied on all contributions to the Trust Fund at the rate of 13% of the total annual expenditures.)
/E (Additional expenses charged to the Trust Fund were for operational, oversight and monitoring activities and for the general management of the Trust Fund. In accordance with United Nations Financial Regulations and as per the Terms of Reference of the Trust Fund, programme support costs \(PSC\) were levied on all contributions to the Trust Fund at the rate of 13% of the total annual expenditures.)
